  "faq": {
    "q1Question": "What is Clickit Story?",
    "q1Answer": "Clickit Story (CIT) is a UAE-based digital media company producing original programs across travel, health, music, comedy, cooking, tech, poetry, and more. This platform is our cinematic streaming home — every Clickit original, in one place.",
    "q2Question": "Is Clickit Story free to watch?",
    "q2Answer": "Yes — every show is free. No subscription, no paywall.",
    "q3Question": "Do I need an account?",
    "q3Answer": "You can browse and watch without an account. Signing in lets you save shows to your list, track progress, and pick up where you left off.",
    "q4Question": "Is the content available in Arabic and English?",
    "q4Answer": "Yes. Every show has titles and descriptions in both languages, and the entire interface switches between English and Arabic.",
    "q5Question": "Where is Clickit Story produced?",
    "q5Answer": "From Yas Creative Hub in Abu Dhabi, UAE. We're operated by Spacelight Studios FZ LLC.",
    "q6Question": "Can I download episodes for offline viewing?",
    "q6Answer": "Not yet — Clickit Story uses YouTube's streaming infrastructure for video delivery. Offline download is on our roadmap.",
    "q7Question": "How do I report a problem with a video?",
    "q7Answer": "Use the Support page to send us a message. Include the show title, episode number, and a short description of what you saw.",
    "q8Question": "Will there be more shows?",
    "q8Answer": "Yes — our catalog grows as new seasons wrap production. Follow our social channels or visit the Coming Soon page for the latest."
  },
